ents></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T07:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T07:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Carried out weekly HSE drill, table top exercise regarding volumetric well control</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T07:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T09:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Continued RIH w/ torque tool. Engaged to tie-back adapter. Marked pipe. Attempted to back out adapter counter clockwise. Applied 25kNm in steps before pipe started to rotate. Than rotated free at 2kNm. Measured distance 1,5in after 5 turns. POOH. Observed no torque tool/X/over on the drill pipe - left in hole</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T09:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T10:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH w/ DP from surface to 137 m. M/U TDS and latched on to fish. POOH from to surface. L/D torque tool</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T10:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T10:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U Left hand Tie-back adapter torque tool and M/U to X/O</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T10:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T12:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH torque tool on 5,5in left hand DP. From surface to 140. P/U singles from cantilever</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T12:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T12:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Left hand X-over arrived on the rig. Inspected and discovered it was right hand X-over. Evaluated situation. Meanwhile performed hydraulic test on BX4.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T12:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T14:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U 1x more joint of DP and M/U to string. Attempted to break off Tie-Back adapter using rig tongs on DP. Pulled +/- 28kNm. Cathead fully stroked out. No success</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T14:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T14:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Evaluated situation. Meanwhile performed tests on Aft iron roughneck</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T14:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T15:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH from 140m to surface. L/D torque tool. Clean and clear rig floor</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T15:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T15:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to P/U drill collars from deck</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T15:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T17:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U and RIH 8,25 DC from surface to 90m (9 joints). R/B same in derrick</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-21T17:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-21T18:00:00+02:00</witsml:d